"慢板如叙往事，一字一叹" = "Slow sections narrate the past, a sigh per note";
"昭君故事入诗入画入乐逾千年" = "Her story has filled poem, painting and music";
"委曲含情，忌直白宣泄" = "Be indirect; never state feeling outright";
"练此曲如读一首叙事长诗" = "Studying it is like reading a long narrative poem";
"听此曲如见塞北孤影，令人动容" = "A lone figure north of the frontier, deeply moving";

"借秋江雁落之景，寓静远之趣" = "Autumn river, geese on level sand";
"原为古琴名曲，后移植为琵琶" = "A guqin classic arranged for Pipa";
"重在静与淡，长音轻柔、不赶节奏" = "Still and pale: soft long notes, no rush";
"琴人崇尚的「静气」尽在此曲" = "The quietness guqin players prize lives here";
"长音余韵，如雁阵渐远" = "Lingering long notes, like geese flying away";
"静弹最难，音少而意不能少" = "Still playing is hardest: fewer notes, no less meaning";
"琴琵琶移植对话的典范之作" = "A model of guqin-Pipa cross-instrument dialogue";
"弹此曲宜心静，急不得" = "Play it with a calm heart; do not hurry";
"由动入静，是演奏也是修行" = "From motion to stillness: performance as practice";
"听此曲如立秋江，天地辽阔" = "By an autumn river, heaven and earth stretch wide";

"以唐代歌舞曲「绿腰」为素材创作" = "Based on the Tang dance tune 'Lvyao'";
"「绿腰」为唐软舞名曲，见唐诗乐志" = "'Lvyao', the famous Tang soft dance";
"重在韵与舞，旋律流畅、古韵含蓄" = "Charm and dance: fluent, with Tang grace";
"「绿腰」又名「六幺」，唐宋风行" = "Also called 'Liuyao', popular in Tang and Song";
"元稹白居易诗中屡见「六幺」" = "Yuan Zhen and Bai Juyi both mention 'Liuyao'";
"羽调式音色，别于一般宫调" = "Its yu mode differs from common gong modes";
"今人据古素材作曲，古韵新声" = "Ancient materials, a modern composition";
"演奏宜带唐代乐舞的雍容气度" = "Carry the poise of Tang music and dance";
"快板如舞袖回旋，慢板如凝神" = "Fast like swirling sleeves, slow like held breath";
"听此曲如回大唐，观一场软舞" = "Back to the Tang, watching a soft dance";

"塔吉克风，写帕米尔高原的阳光歌舞" = "Tajik style: Pamir sun, song and dance";
"原为小提琴曲，吸收塔吉克民歌" = "A violin solo on Tajik folk tunes";
"重在烈与舞，扫拂饱满、切分清楚" = "Fire and dance: full sweeps, clear beats";
"帕米尔高原上的塔吉克族歌舞" = "Tajik song and dance on the Pamir plateau";
"新疆民歌常伴手鼓起舞" = "Xinjiang folk songs often pair with hand drums";
"七拍子与附点，奏出舞蹈律动" = "Seven-beat bars and dots give the dance lilt";
"移植曲显琵琶音色可塑性" = "Arrangements show the Pipa's tonal flexibility";
"由弱至强，如日出渐暖高原" = "Soft to strong, like sunrise warming the plateau";
"音域跨度大，换把需干净" = "A wide range demands clean position shifts";
"听此曲如赴高原，与民同舞" = "To the plateau, dancing with the people";

"琵琶协奏曲，写草原英雄小姐妹" = "A Pipa concerto about the grassland heroines";
"1973 年吴祖强王燕樵刘德海作曲" = "Composed 1973 by Wu Zuqiang, Wang Yanqiao and Liu Dehai";
"长轮绵绵，如风雪漫天呼啸" = "Long rolls pile up like a snowstorm's howl";
"小姐妹护羊群，与暴风雪搏斗" = "Two sisters fight the blizzard to save the flock";
"琵琶与乐队协奏的开山之作" = "The pioneering Pipa-and-orchestra concerto";
"「草原牧歌」主题宽广深情" = "The Grassland Pastoral theme, broad and warm";
"由静到动，层次一层层推进" = "From stillness to motion, layer by layer";
"轮指扫弦并举，摹风号雪舞" = "Rolls and sweeps together trace wind and snow";
"故事原型是草原上的小姐妹" = "Based on a true story from the grasslands";
"听此曲如见草原风雪中的青春" = "Youth standing in the grassland wind and snow";

"任鸿翔作曲，写秦地渭水悠悠" = "Ren Hongxiang's tribute to the Wei River's flow";
"1984 年创作的西北风情名曲" = "A 1984 classic in northwestern style";
"重在情与韵，推拉吟揉诉乡愁" = "Feeling and vibrato voice deep homesickness";
"渭水汤汤，姜尚曾垂钓于此" = "The Wei River, where Jiang Ziya once fished";
"碗碗腔韵味，秦声激越深沉" = "Bowl-cavity Qinqiang flavour, bold and deep";
"慢板如叙往事，情深意长" = "The slow section tells old tales at length";
"快板热烈奔放，见西北豪气" = "The fast section burns with northwest fire";
"一水连古今，乡愁越千年" = "One river links past and present, longing endures";
"吟揉之间，听黄土高原的风" = "In every bend, wind off the loess plateau";
"听此曲如立渭水边，思接千载" = "Standing by the Wei, thoughts across a thousand years";

"《大浪淘沙》开阔深沉，如江水奔涌，意在沉静中见深远。" = "Big Waves Wash the Sand is broad and deep, like a river in flood, depth found in stillness.";
"《阳春白雪》清新明快，旋律如春风拂面，贵在干净流畅。" = "Sunny Spring and White Snow is fresh and bright, its melody like a spring breeze, clean and flowing.";
"《昭君出塞》哀婉深沉，写去国怀乡之愁，贵在含蓄内在。" = "Zhaojun Beyond the Great Wall is plaintive and deep, voicing the sorrow of leaving home, inward and restrained.";
"《平沙落雁》清幽淡远，写秋江暮霭、雁落沙平之境。" = "Geese Landing on the Sandbank is quiet and far-reaching: autumn river, evening mist, geese on level sand.";
"《新番羽调绿腰》富丽典雅，以唐韵乐舞为意，贵在流畅与气韵。" = "Green Waist Dance (Yu Mode) is rich and elegant, in the spirit of Tang music and dance, fluent with grace.";
"《阳光照耀着塔什库尔干》热烈奔放，写帕米尔高原的阳光与歌舞。" = "Sunshine Shines over Tashkurgan is fervent and free, painting the Pamir's sunshine, song and dance.";
"《草原小姐妹》是琵琶协奏曲名作，写草原姐妹顶风冒雪守护羊群的英勇故事。" = "Grassland Sisters is a celebrated Pipa concerto telling of two sisters who brave wind and snow to guard their flock.";
"《渭水情》以西北秦地风格写对渭水与故乡的眷恋，深情而豪迈。" = "Feelings of the Wei River is written in northwestern Qin style, voicing deep attachment to the Wei River and home—tender yet bold.";

"你在舒缓的长音里守住了难得的沉静，声音越来越有江水的深度，这份定力很可贵。" = "You held a rare stillness in those relaxed long notes, and your tone grows ever deeper; this composure is precious.";
"你的演奏明亮而不浮躁，弹挑干净、气息轻盈，把春天的清爽劲儿带出来了。" = "Your playing is bright yet unhurried, with clean plucks and light breath; you have brought out the freshness of spring.";
"你在推拉吟揉间注入了细腻的情绪，慢板里的牵挂与不舍让人动容，很有感染力。" = "You poured subtle feeling into every push, pull and vibrato; the longing in the slow passages is genuinely moving.";
"你肯在音乐里「留白」，让声音静下来，这份淡远从容正是这首曲子的味道。" = "You dare to leave silence in the music, letting the sound settle; this calm distance is exactly the flavour of the piece.";
"你的乐句流畅而有分寸，古韵里带着生动的舞意，气度越来越好。" = "Your phrasing is fluent and well measured, ancient charm carried with vivid dance, your presence growing ever surer.";
"你的演奏像高原的阳光一样透亮，节奏向前、情绪饱满，听得出心里的那份火热。" = "Your playing is as clear as plateau sunshine, rhythm driving and feeling full; the fire in your heart comes through.";
"你在风雪般的急奏里守住了力量与控制的平衡，把小姐妹的勇敢一点点奏出来了，很有画面感。" = "In the blizzard-like flurries you kept power and control in balance, bringing out the sisters' courage bit by bit—truly vivid.";
"你的吟揉里带着黄土高原的厚意，慢板处的乡愁真挚动人，越弹越有味道了。" = "Your vibrato carries the deep sincerity of the loess plateau; the homesickness in the slow passages is genuinely touching, and richer with every phrase.";

"注重旋律的连贯与气息感，练习时以连奏与揉弦让乐句如歌般流畅。" = "Focus on melodic continuity and breath: use legato and vibrato so phrases flow like song.";
"加强力度层次，用渐强渐弱突出乐曲的表现与意境。" = "Strengthen dynamic layering: use crescendo and diminuendo to bring out expression and mood.";
